member.returns:
Returns  if the frame is identified as external code by JMC or external code info providers (Output assemblies check),
 if the status cannot be determined (JMC check is true, but external code info providers failed (no output assemblies info)
or  if the frame is identified as user code by both JMC check and external code info providers.

