member.summary:
Like type of elements of primitive array, int[] -> elements can only be ints
Or for records when they ToString returns a string with the type name in the beginning
Frontend uses this flag to omit the type left to the value
  Before : var myRecord = {MyRecord} MyRecord { name="Jenya" }
  After  : var myRecord = MyRecord { name="Jenya" }


